 34S     24MG(16O,A2PG)                2005MA03                  ENSDF    202609
 34S   H TYP=FUL$AUT=LIJIE SUN AND JUN CHEN$CIT=ENSDF$CUT=30-Sep-2026$          
 34S   H TYP=FUL$AUT=NINEL NICA, BALRAJ SINGH$CIT=NDS 113, 1563 (2012)$         
 34S 2 H CUT=28-May-2012$                                                       
 34S  c  2005Ma03: {+24}Mg({+16}O,|a2p|g) with a 70-MeV 16O beam from the XTU   
 34S 2c  Tandem accelerator at the Legnaro National Laboratory. Targets were    
 34S 3c  400-ug/cm2 self-supporting {+24}Mg and 750-ug/cm2 {+24}Mg on a         
 34S 4c  15-mg/cm2 {+197}Au backing. |g rays were detected using the GASP array 
 34S 5c  consisting of 40 Compton-suppressed HPGe detectors and a multiplicity  
 34S 6c  filter of 80 BGO scintillators. Charged particles were detected using  
 34S 7c  the ISIS array consisting of 40 |DE-E Si telescopes for channel        
 34S 8c  selection and kinematical reconstruction. Measured E|g, I|g, |g|g-coin,
 34S 9c  |g(|q), |g|g(|q)(ADO), particle-|g-coin. Deduced levels, J, |p,        
 34S Ac  lifetimes using the Doppler-shift attenuation method (DSAM) lineshape  
 34S Bc  analysis, band structures, multipolarities, and transition strengths.  
 34S  cG $Expected R{-ADO} values are 0.75 for stretched dipole (|DJ=1) and 1.25
 34S 2cG for stretched quadrupole (|DJ=2) transitions.                          
 34S  cG M,MR$From |g(|q), |g|g(|q)(ADO) data, and RUL when T{-1/2} is available
 34S 2cG in 2005Ma03.                                                           
 34S  cL E$From a least-squares fit to |g-ray energies in 2005Ma03.             
 34S  cL J$Adopted by evaluators assuming that spins increase with increasing   
 34S 2cL excitation energy. For specific arguments see comments, where the      
 34S 3cL assignments of 2005Ma03 are given for completeness                     
 34S  cL BAND(A)$Ground-state band.                                             
 34S  cL SEQ(B)$Sequence based on 5680 level.                                   
 34S  cL SEQ(C)$Sequence based on 4624 level.                                   
